   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Libya - Flash Appeal 2011 UNHCR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Libya - blixtappell 2011 UNHCR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till FNs blixtappell 2011 f&#xf6;r UNHCR.                              Totalt beslut 20 MSEK, varav UNHCR 12 MSEK, UNICEF 5 MSEK och        Islamic Relief Sverige 3 MSEK. St&#xf6;det v&#xe4;ntas bidra till transitl&#xe4;ger  f&#xf6;r de i f&#xf6;rsta hand tredjelandsmedborgare som flytt Libyen, att      deras humanit&#xe4;ra r&#xe4;ttigheter m&#xf6;ts, och m&#xf6;jlig tranport till           heml&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UN Flash Appeal 2011 for UNHCR.                             Totalt decision 20 MSEK, of which UNHCR 12 MSEK, UNICEF 5 MSEK and   Islamic Relief Sweden 3 MSEK. Support contributes to transit campls   for mainly TCNs which have fled from Libya, that their human rights   are met and possible transport to country of origin. For Tunisia,     Egypt, Niger, Algeria and in Libya when access is possible.</narrative>
  </description>
